Palettes get smarter: one tap sorts your colors into grays-first hue ramps (extracted palettes arrive pre-sorted), and you can now name individual colors. The Gradient tool takes up to 6 colors with transparency shown right on the swatches, and Select Color can sample the whole picture or just the active layer. Search is now a swipe away on the home screen, the Player Bar hides itself where it can't act, and the Move tool got bug fixes.
